  "title": "Join the September 10th, 2026 Knowledge Portal Webinar!",
  "summary": "Learn about \"A Unified Model of Direct Genetic Support: Framework for Analysis of Linkage and Combined Omics using Networks (FALCON).\"",
  "bodyHtml": "<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(33, 37, 41);font-family:Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Join us for the next Knowledge Portal Network webinar:<br />🧬 A Unified Model of Direct Genetic Support: Framework for Analysis of Linkage and Combined Omics using Networks (FALCON)<br />📆 Thursday, September 10th, 2026<br />⏰ 12:00–1:00 PM ET<br />🎙️ Featured speakers: Edgar Alejandro Llamas Mejia, PhD</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(33, 37, 41);font-family:Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Topics we will cover:</p><ol><li>The FALCON model</li><li>How to use the method to perform cross-program gene set evaluations</li><li>Address questions in real-time<br /> </li></ol><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(33, 37, 41);font-family:Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">💻 <a style=\"background-color:transparent;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 123, 255);text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://broadinstitute.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN__dgDoIUZSVyPwKvZ3Xx7mQ\">Register for the event</a></p><img src=\"https://kp4cd.org/sites/default/files/September%2010th%2C%202026%20KPN%20Webinar.png\" data-entity-uuid=\"db3483fc-30b4-4baa-8368-85657cfdb068\" data-entity-type=\"file\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" />",
